Modifications and Extensions
=============================

The SIFTA implementation includes modifications and extensions specific to
the PrismaDV project, including:

- Custom fitness functions for data validation accuracy
- Integration with PrismaDV constraint generation pipeline
- Specialized sampling strategies for validation rule examples
- Adaptation to PyDeequ constraint DSL

These modifications are part of the PrismaDV project.

